 \left\{\widehat Q(\alpha):
 \widehat r(\alpha)\geq\widehat r^*-\delta\right\},\qquad\delta=10^{-3}.
 \label{eq:6-oracle}
\end{equation}
This diagnostic uses labels/timings; its recall slack $\delta$ differs from the slot allowance $\epsilon$.

